1. overcurrent

adc samples the current sensor and sends that data 
through dma and the dma interrupts when it's half full

set the clock configuration to have this interrupt
run every 1ms

in the interrupt check if it's high enough to warrant
immediate shut off as a last line of protection

if it's less than 100% overcurrent, exit and return
normally

if over 100% overcurrent, launch a deffered task
with the current passed through 

the deffered task calculates in a reiman summ whether
the overcurrent was occuring for long enough to trigger
a disconnect


